📦 3) Contrato del Repository (Dominio)

Domain depende de un protocolo.

protocol CardUpgradeRepository {
    func loadOffer(request: [String: Any]) async throws -> OfferModel
    func validateLimits(request: [String: Any]) async throws -> String
}

Observa:
	•	validateLimits devuelve operationId
	•	Si falla → lanza error
	•	No devuelve status HTTP

